abstract: >-
  Reproducibility software and compact derived data for a fixed-weight
  state-reachability audit of a mass-conserving recurrent rainfall-runoff
  model. The package separates analysis-level reproduction from a
  claim-specific one-checkpoint model replay.
keywords:
  - hydrological model diagnostics
  - physics-guided machine learning
  - mass conservation
  - state reachability
  - large-sample hydrology
